    "message": "chore: adopt trusted completion recovery and align its runtime view (#575)\n\nAdopts the workflows qualified with CLI 0.12.64 and SDLC 0.22.3 at\n`39a8fd2`. Trusted rejected-review preparation now signals the existing\nreconciler directly; native completion and the scheduled sweep retain\nthe same bounded 1/1 recovery. Two concise runtime views document the\ninstalled behavior and authority boundary.\n\n[Native acceptance and original\nevidence](https://github.com/juangcarmona/lighthouse/tree/468581aca06c8dd9c1184df025ba215177275a4f/acceptance/20261108-worker-completion/567/accepted-72):\nthe old review was rejected before agent/publication, the bot callback\ncreated one linked retry after 60 seconds, the recovered review passed\nand the bot closed the consumer issue. No owner action followed the\nrejection; merge, original CI and product apply were reused. A later\ndiagnostic sweep created no further delivery effects. The seed was\nsupervised; observed latency is not an SLA and actual cron delivery is\nnot claimed.\n\nValidation: repository and site CI passed on `6898341`; all workflow\nsource pins match the published qualified source. Product model and\npolicies are unchanged. Product validation, citations and Markdown\nchecks passed.\n\nRefs #567.",
